  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Territories Scholarship Support 2021-2022 (in-country)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides management support to the Australia Awards Scholarships program in the Palestinian Territories. Scholarships are provided at Masters&#x2019; level in the priority sectors determined each year. Australia&#x2019;s scholarships focus on building public sector management skills within the Palestinian Authority (PA) and civic institutions. In-country mobilisation costs are required to meet the Australia Awards Scholarship intakes for the planned 2021 and 2022 Palestinian Territories awardees.</narrative>
  </description>
